	<sys:String x:Key="str.Pointers.VersionTooOld">引擎版本过低，最低支持UE4.11，4.10及以下无FUObjectItem结构无法扫描</sys:String>
    <!-- Separate from VersionTooOld on purpose: that message's remedy line ("set a UE version
         override") is actively WRONG here. The override list has no value below UE 4.18, and no
         value at any version would help, because the structures being looked for do not exist in
         a pre-UE4 binary at all. Keeping two strings also keeps the 4.10 explanation truthful —
         4.10 is still a live case, with two reference builds in the AOB corpus. -->
	<sys:String x:Key="str.Pointers.EnginePreUE4">检测到虚幻3，无全局对象数组，扫描已跳过</sys:String>
	<sys:String x:Key="str.Pointers.VersionWarning">⚠ 未自动识别引擎版本，推测值可能有误</sys:String>
	<sys:String x:Key="str.Pointers.VersionDetectedBadge">✓ 自动识别</sys:String>
	<sys:String x:Key="str.Pointers.VersionUserOverrideBadge">🔧 手动指定</sys:String>
	<sys:String x:Key="str.Pointers.VersionUserOverrideTooltip">手动覆盖引擎版本，按游戏独立保存</sys:String>
	<sys:String x:Key="str.Pointers.VersionLowConfidenceBadge">⚠ 识别可信度低</sys:String>
	<sys:String x:Key="str.Pointers.VersionLowConfidenceText">通过简易特征匹配识别，导出数据异常请手动指定版本</sys:String>
	<sys:String x:Key="str.Pointers.VersionOverrideLabel">版本覆盖：</sys:String>
	<sys:String x:Key="str.Pointers.VersionOverrideTooltip">强制指定虚幻版本，自动恢复选择Auto</sys:String>
	<sys:String x:Key="str.Pointers.InvokeTimeoutLabel">函数调用超时(毫秒)：</sys:String>
